{"id":404103501,"chapter_id":50085,"scene_id":58519,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"【研究所走廊，或许想调一个落日的颜色滤镜】","style":18,"background":2443,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"离开了阴暗昏沉的地下，萨法尔重新感受到阳光的温度。","style":3,"background":2443,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"研究所内的人员早已撤走。室内异常安静，只能隐隐听到外面传来的喧闹声。","style":3,"background":2443,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"【闪回，背景变换】","style":18,"background":2446,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"在攻击的轰鸣间，萨法尔听到有人在自己耳边落下一句话。","style":3,"background":2446,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"西涅克斯","content":"打工也要动脑子，别给坎贝尔当牛做马这么多年，只长个子不长脑子。看在老同事的份儿上，我再偷偷附赠一条特别消息……","voice":["vo_event_404103402_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41034","style":1,"background":2446,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"西涅克斯","content":"都到最后了，去看看真相吧。我告诉你该去哪。","voice":["vo_event_404103402_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41034","style":1,"background":2446,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"【闪回结束】","style":18,"background":2443,"hide_button":true,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"深呼吸，萨法尔推开所长办公室的大门。顺着指引，他终于找到一处隐蔽的抽屉。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"萨法尔","content":"……？！","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"几分钟后，青年恍惚地走出大门。","style":3,"background":2443,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"白日所剩不多，西沉的太阳将他的影子拉的很长，也让萨法尔注意到走廊另一端，那个隐藏在阴影中的人。","style":3,"background":2443,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"萨法尔","content":"你……有什么话要跟我说？","voice":["vo_event_404103501_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41035","style":1,"background":2443,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"黑袍人没有说话，只是抬手指向下。","style":3,"background":2443,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"地下？西涅克斯的迷宫？入侵者？还是……","style":3,"background":2443,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"萨法尔","content":"……海拉？","voice":["vo_event_404103501_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41035","style":1,"background":2443,"log_type":1}]}